19. Performance Tuning
Know how to diagnose:
•	High CPU usage
•	Memory leaks
•	Thread contention
•	GC pauses
•	Slow SQL
•	High latency
•	Connection pool exhaustion
•	Thread pool starvation
Use tools such as:
•	JDK Flight Recorder (JFR)
•	Java Mission Control (JMC)
•	VisualVM
•	jstack
•	jmap
•	jcmd
