20. Be Able to Explain Real Production Decisions
This is what distinguishes strong candidates.
Prepare detailed stories about:
•	A production incident you resolved
•	A memory leak investigation
•	A performance optimization
•	Reducing API latency
•	Scaling a service under increased traffic
•	Fixing concurrency issues
•	Improving deployment reliability
•	Designing a new service from scratch
•	Leading a technical migration
•	Mentoring developers and conducting code reviews
Interviewers often probe these experiences because they reveal your depth of understanding and decision-making.

